    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274884</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あなたたち、
あのおじいさんと
喋ってたでしょ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You all were just
talking to that
older man, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274936</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あの人って……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Who do you mean...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275036</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>記憶を失ってる
っていうあの人よ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You know, the man
with amnesia.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275036</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もしかして、知り合い？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You don't happen to know him?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275096</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そういうわけじゃないけど？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, no, but?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あら、そう、がっかり……
身元を知ってる方が
いらしたのかと思ったわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, I see, that's disappointing... I was
thinking someone had come along who
knew where he was from.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275288</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>じゃあ……あの人が、
誰かは誰も知らないの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then...no one really
knows who he is?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275400</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ずっと昔、殺された人たちの
仲間じゃないかって
言われてるけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, people say he was mixed up
with that bunch who got killed
here a long, long time ago...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ずっと昔？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A long, long time ago?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あら、それも知らないの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, you don't know about that, either?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Klarth&gt;さんに
教えてもらわなかった？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Klarth&gt; never told
you about it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275652</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え……あ、いや……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh... Well, I don't...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275760</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Klarth&gt;さん、自分に
かかわりのないこと、全然
知ろうとしないのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're always willfilly ignorant
about anything that doesn't
involve you, aren't you, &lt;Klarth&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275820</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>自分の村のことなのに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's your own village, too...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275920</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よけいな情報を入れると、
大切な知識が抜け落ちる
危険があるからな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, if I try to store too much
information, I might end up losing
the more important knowledge.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276068</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>少しくらいは
関心持ってほしい
ところだけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You could stand to
be a little more
curious, you know.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276068</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうせ、私の名前も
知らないでしょ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You don't even know
my name, do you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276068</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ま、いいけど。
それより</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, anyway, like
I was saying.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276312</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あの人がこの村に居ついた
８０年くらい前にね、人が
殺された事件があったのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>About eighty years before
that man settled down here,
some people were killed.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276312</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>２０人くらい？
一太刀の元にみんな、
斬られてたって言うわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Twenty people, or so? They
say each one of them was
killed with one sword stroke.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276312</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>目撃した人によると、みんな、
ひとりの老人にやられた
って話だけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The eyewitnesses said
they were all done in by
the same, single old man.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276356</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>老人……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Old man...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276560</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>彼はその時の生き残り</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He was the only one who
survived back then.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>changed based on context -kev</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276560</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よっぽどひどい目に遭ったのか、
その時のこと、聞こうとすると、
すごく怯えるのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maybe something really horrible happened
to him back then, because he gets
scared any time we ask about it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276560</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>結局、亡くなった人たちも
何者かよくわからなかったし……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In the end, no one ever figured
out who the dead were, either.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Rody&gt;？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Rody&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276688</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、ううん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uh, I'm fine...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276688</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この辺り、物騒だね。
気をつけないと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's pretty dangerous around
here, isn't it? Let's be careful.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276824</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あはは、そんなこと、
滅多にないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahaha, no, it really isn't.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276824</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>魔物にさえ、
気をつけていれば、
なんてことないんだから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>As long as you're careful
of the monsters, nothing
ever really happens here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうしたんですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's wrong?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276920</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>変だぜ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're acting weird...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277020</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>えへ、そうかもね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ehe... I guess I am.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277020</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あの人とどこで会ったか、
なんとなく思い出したかも</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I think I might have remembered
where it was I saw him.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277064</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>マジでか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Seriously?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん……あの人、
誘拐犯さんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah... He was one
of the kidnappers.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277224</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え……それって前に言ってた、
&lt;Rody&gt;さんを
誘拐したっていう？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh...? He's one of the people
who kidnapped you, &lt;Rody&gt;?
Like we talked about before?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277272</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>たぶんね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Probably...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277368</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだよ、そんなヤツ、
こんなとこにほっといたら、
ヤバくねか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What the hell... If he's a jerk
like that, isn't it pretty dangerous
to just leave him here?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>大丈夫だよ。
たぶん、もう何も
できないと、思うから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's fine. He probably
won't do much harm
anymore, anyway.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>仲間が殺された、
それを目にして、
記憶を失った</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The rest of his group were
all killed, he saw it all happen,
and he lost his memory.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>たぶん、相当怖い目に
遭ったんだと思う。
だから……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He probably saw something
really horrible back then, so...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう、なのかな……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh, you think so...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277652</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>たぶん、ね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Probably.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>父さん……だね……
やっぱり……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So...it was you, Dad...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
